      "message": "Now that the host \"board\" has CONFIG_ALWAYS_MEMSET, I had to add this, otherwise when you \"make host-cr50_fuzz\" it sees CONFIG_ALWAYS_MEMSET and tries to build cryptoc_objs and cannot find it. Is there a way to configure fuzz/build.mk to make this work for fuzz builds also?",
