      "message": "If we\u0027re not calling any of the other functions in cryptoc, we should be able to have the linker optimize them out. I can\u0027t remember offhand if we need additional linker flags for that (e.g., \"--gc-sections\" or \"-flto\").\n\nIt should be possible to check the final symbols that end up in the RW.elf binary with \"nm\" or \"objdump\" to see if the other cryptoc symbols are present or not with the existing build.",
